				"doc": "The dressing: grass, reeds, flowers, stumps, mushrooms, pebbles, bones, a broken pillar, a dune, a snow drift, an ice floe. Nothing the fight sees: nobody is stopped, slowed or hidden by it. One a cell; it may share a cell with a Things entity.",
